<title>USA: Princeton Dental extends warrants by year.</title>
<headline>Princeton Dental extends warrants by year.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEVIEW, Ill. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Princeton Dental Management Corp said on Tuesday that its board extended the October 14, 1996 expiration date on warrants issued April 15, 1992 for a year, to October 14, 1997.</p>
<p>The warrants were issued in connection with an agreement between Princeton Dental and Continental Stock Transfer &amp; Trust Co.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
